Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:06.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Marinforest is home \Nto a human king and three fairy kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:11.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Forest Fairy King, \Nthe land is blessed with abundance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:13.62,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and its fertility is guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:17.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Sky Fairy King, \Nthe air is very clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:20.62,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and there is never a shortage \Nof life-giving rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Sea Fairy King,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,things like coral, pearls, \Nand fish are abundant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.13,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and bring prosperity to the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:32.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Everyone in the Marinforest \Nroyal family is loved by the fairies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:34.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and has received their blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:40.73,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The fairies' power is vital \Nin supporting the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:59.41,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:17.03,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\pos(320,123)\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25}{\c&H343E6B&}The {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Mermaid{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Knows Not of {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:21.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'll undergo bridal training \Nfor the next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:26.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I do feel a bit sad about \Nleaving my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:30.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Tiara? \NIs something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:32.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:36.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No, I'm very excited to go to Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:40.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sure I will miss \Nmy homeland at times,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:43.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but you'll be with me, so I'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:48.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly... You always \Nsay such adorable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:51.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If there's ever anything troubling you, \Ntell me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:52.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:55.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Of course, if you tell me \Nyou want to go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:58.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I don't have the slightest shred \Nof confidence that I could let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:00.34,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:05.16,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that the border?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:06.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:10.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,On Lapis Lazuli's side, you can see roses,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:15.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but on Marinforest's side, \Nthe border is decorated differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:21.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Wow! It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:27.60,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll surprise you even more. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:36.32,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,So this is the Kingdom of Marinforest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:50.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,This is the first time \NI've ever seen the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:53.93,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,No need to rush. \NThe ocean won't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:03.01,Default,Sea FairyA,0,0,0,,It's Aquasteed and Elliot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.13,Default,Sea FairyB,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.39,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:09.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:12.33,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Have you all been well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:15.50,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with them, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.26,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Let's go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:20.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, let's. \NMaybe they'll be our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.87,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:29.49,Default,Sea FairyA,0,0,0,,Ew! I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:30.62,Default,Sea FairyB,0,0,0,,Don't touch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Fairies are fickle creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:37.55,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I have heard people say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:39.45,Default,Sea FairyA,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:42.33,Default,Sea FairyB,0,0,0,,I know who! \NThey were calling her "Philine"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:44.62,Default,Sea FairyC,0,0,0,,I like Philine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:50.39,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Why?! Lady Tiararose is \N{\i1}far{\i0} more worthy of your favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:56.45,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I do feel sad that \Nthey don't like me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.45,0:04:58.40,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You can take your time, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:04.23,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm actually relieved \Nthey didn't take you from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:05.91,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:08.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:23.43,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&HCE99E8&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(324,287)}Icilla Pearllant
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.42,0:05:23.43,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,1)\fnArial\shad0\c&HE4E3C5&\3c&H737588&\bord1.5\pos(324,287)}Icilla Pearllant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.12,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.12,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:30.86,Flashback,Akari FB,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)}The sequel's heroine is a duke's \Ndaughter in Marinforest named Icilla,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.34,Flashback,Akari FB,0,0,0,,and just when Prince Aqua \Nis feeling fed up with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:36.55,Flashback,Akari FB,0,0,0,,{\t(2161,3663,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}the fiancée the state chose for him, \Nhe meets her on the seashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.15,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, \Nit's so good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.18,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, it has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:47.40,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Did you swim all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:51.50,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Yes, I was swimming with the \Nsea fairies, and I ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.02,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:58.00,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,And... this is someone \NI haven't met before, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:01.66,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,My name is Icilla Pearllant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,This is my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.01,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:09.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My name is Tiararose Lapis Clamentile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:12.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:16.02,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The Pearllants are the ducal family \Nthat oversees the oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:21.69,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Icilla is skilled at raising fish, \Ncorals, and other things in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:25.03,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She always helps me with my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:30.33,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to continue \Nto be useful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:34.76,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Oh, and please come visit \Nour house again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:38.25,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I always looked forward to your visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:41.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll visit soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:45.77,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is it possible that I'm the\Nvillainess in the sequel as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:49.59,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Yes, my existence is definitely irregular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:52.77,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I might be completely \Nremoved from the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:55.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If I am, then once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:59.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I'm going to rest \Nby the carriage for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:01.68,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:12.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting the heroine \Nto show up so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.38,Italics,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:20.77,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What face should I make when I return?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:25.34,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm not confident that I can act cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,How troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.59,Default,Forest FairyA,0,0,0,,You're troubled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Forest... fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.35,0:07:46.34,Default,Forest FairyB,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:50.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, my name is \NTiararose Lapis Clamentile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.78,Default,Forest FairyA,0,0,0,,Tiara! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.36,Default,Forest FairyB,0,0,0,,I love Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:59.37,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:03.17,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Forest fairies \Ndon't normally like people,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.17,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,yet they're blessing her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:08.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Elliot? What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.49,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Oh, I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:13.88,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I've been following behind\Nat a short distance to guard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:17.14,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Did you wander out here alone \Nbecause something is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:19.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:23.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I was in the carriage for a long time, \Nso I wanted to stretch my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.96,Default,Forest FairyA,0,0,0,,Tiara, you're not happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:28.40,Default,Forest FairyB,0,0,0,,This flower is really tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.33,Default,Forest FairyC,0,0,0,,It's blessed by the forest fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:31.91,Default,Forest FairyC,0,0,0,,Eat it! Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:36.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:40.14,Default,Forest Fairies,0,0,0,,She feels better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.63,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:46.24,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was walking around \Nover there a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:49.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Please don't worry me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Take me with you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:56.55,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Are you hungry? \NI brought some sweets with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm so fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Instead of being so afraid of the heroine,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:07.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I should treasure all the wonderful \Npeople who support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:10.99,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(478,1)\shad0\fs24.5\pos(323,295)\b1\fnArial\c&H2E4074&\3c&HF0F3F7&\blur2}The Castle of Marinforest
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:14.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I bet you've never taken such \Na long carriage ride before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:16.83,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.00,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:21.83,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,As I mentioned, there'll be \Na welcome party for you in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:26.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I will arrange a dress for you, \Nof course, so please wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You'll arrange a dress for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:31.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:39.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:41.97,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,A whole year until we're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:52.53,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That's too long. \NI want to make you my wife right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:10:01.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm going to complete my bridal training \Nand be helpful to you as your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:03.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Just wait a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:05.62,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:13.48,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:17.51,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I gave you the half-up style that's \Npopular in Marinforest right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.93,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's lovely. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:22.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You've always been so good \Nat doing my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.07,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,This is where we encounter a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:27.21,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,What should we do about a hair accessory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:30.13,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I'd like something that looks \Nspecial for the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:33.37,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,In that case, how about these?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:36.22,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,They were all picked \Nfrom the castle courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:40.04,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,Flowers like these are \Na specialty of Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They're lovely! Aren't they, Philine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:45.54,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure they'll suit you perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:49.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um... do you have one \Nin a deep blue color?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:51.96,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,A deep... blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:57.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I thought it might be nice to wear one\Nthe same color as Prince Aqua's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:11:00.47,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Oh! That's a very good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:05.94,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, but there are \Nno blue flowers this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:07.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.04,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,What could this mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.95,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,It must be a gift from the forest fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:20.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,A gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:24.86,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,Yes. You may be the only one \Nin the kingdom right now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:27.46,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,who's received \Nthe forest fairies' blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:31.42,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,There are some who are blessed \Nby the sea or sky fairies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:35.22,Default,MaidA,0,0,0,,but we never hear of anyone being \Nblessed by the forest fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:39.00,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Amazing! Isn't this wonderful, \NLady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:19.93,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Honestly, my Tiara \Nis so adorable, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:20.90,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:24.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Those blue roses in your hair \Nare beautiful, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:27.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,They're the same color as my hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:31.06,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,so it feels as if I'm under the illusion \Nthat all of you belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:36.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But all of me does belong \Nto you, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:42.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I am deeply honored to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:45.24,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I hope we will enjoy a favorable \Nrelationship for years to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:50.00,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord1.5\fs16\blur2\pos(320,245)}King of Marinforest
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.58,0:12:50.00,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord0.5\fs16\pos(320,245)}King of Marinforest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:50.00,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&HE0BCA7&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(320,274)}Sotiris Marinforest
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.58,0:12:50.00,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&HC49579&\3c&H5B5681&\bord1.5\pos(320,274)}Sotiris Marinforest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:50.75,Default - Top,Sotiris,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, Marinforest \Nwarmly welcomes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:55.92,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord1.5\fs16\blur2\pos(320,245)}Queen
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.29,0:12:55.92,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&H363A71&\3c&HDED7D3&\bord0.5\fs16\pos(320,245)}Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:55.92,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&HE0BCA7&\3c&HC2B1BA&\bord2.5\blur2\pos(320,274)}Lavina Marinforest
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.29,0:12:55.92,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(477,485)\fnArial\shad0\c&HBF58C5&\3c&H564689&\bord1.5\pos(320,274)}Lavina Marinforest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:56.25,Default - Top,Lavina,0,0,0,,We are terribly pleased to have \Na lovely young lady like you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:59.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You honor me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:02.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I will devote myself \Nto my studies for the next year
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:05.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,in hopes of supporting\NPrince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:08.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm so looking forward to \Nthe future that lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:12.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, \NI won't run away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:15.82,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, Lady Tiararose,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:18.03,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,congratulations on your engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.39,0:13:21.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:23.70,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What do you think of Marinforest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:26.03,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Are you able to live here \Nwithout difficulty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:31.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. Prince Aquasteed is taking \Nvery good care of me, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:32.97,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:36.65,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I would love to become \Nbetter friends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:40.05,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Please pay a visit to my home sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:40.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:45.80,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla's mansion sits next \Nto the foremost ocean in Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sure you would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:53.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I would love to visit sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.30,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:58.53,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll show you \Nthe finest hospitality I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:01.37,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,All right. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:06.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I don't want to get involved with her, \Nbut she's moving in quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:13.04,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:23.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm actually going to \Nvisit Lady Icilla now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.06,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:31.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sorry to ask this of you, Tarmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:35.56,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,Not at all. I am your personal \Nknight, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:37.48,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,You are free to ask anything of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:39.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:48.49,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, \Nthank you for coming to visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:53.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:57.10,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Please, follow me. \NI'll show you around the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:58.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:09.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, my! I've never seen \Nsuch pretty fish before!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:13.30,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,The water in this fountain is seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:18.77,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,These little fish are a rare species \Nthat only lives in my ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:21.03,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She's definitely the sequel's heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:22.78,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Her backstory is solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:27.07,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I've prepared tea for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:36.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The ocean is just \Nas beautiful as I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:39.43,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Would you like to try going in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:40.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:42.49,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.49,0:15:46.36,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I've been blessed by the sea fairies,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:50.08,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,so I can use magic that makes \Nbreathing underwater possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:52.27,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I can even make\Na layer of air around your body
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:55.46,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,so you can go in the water \Nwithout getting your clothes wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:15:59.89,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She's definitely the sequel's heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:01.47,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Anything goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:06.17,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Do I stand a chance \Nagainst a kind heroine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.07,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,who's loved by the fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.61,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,My father told me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:14.69,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,that you and Prince \NAquasteed met at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.69,0:16:15.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:19.22,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,So you two will be marrying out of love?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.04,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:22.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:26.55,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Does Lady Icilla not love Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:30.55,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You are beautiful yourself, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:33.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Aren't you surrounded by men \Nwho won't leave you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:37.18,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, please! \NThat isn't so at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:42.02,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I have entrusted every aspect \Nof my engagement to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:46.53,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm happy as long as I can be in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:50.28,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,See how beautifully the fish \Nand coral have grown?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:54.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But are there no men \Nyou've fallen in love with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:59.29,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,No. It's embarrassing to admit, \Nbut I've yet to fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:02.50,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It seems hard to believe \Nshe could be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:05.75,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How can someone be so pure, \Nsweet, and honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.60,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Would you like to go into the ocean now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:11.01,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,There are so many cute fish there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:12.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:20.19,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Grant us your blessing \Nto dive into the blue depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:40.16,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They don't even run away from humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:44.17,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,No. I'm down here in the ocean every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:46.67,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,so I'm friends with the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She's like a sea goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:52.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The coral is beautiful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:55.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You make accessories \Nand things from it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:18:00.89,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Yes, thankfully, there are \Nmany who favor our coral products.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:02.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:07.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I never dreamed I'd be \Nable to walk under the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.01,0:18:10.43,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,To think there was such a \Nbeautiful world to be found down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:13.04,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:18.12,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll go back up first \Nand prepare some warm tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:21.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:25.18,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,No, please, take this opportunity \Nto enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:27.52,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,The fish are happy you're here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:30.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,All right, then, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:36.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It seems like she really \Nis a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:38.60,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,And yet, here I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:43.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's so pretty. I'm glad I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:54.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.96,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No... But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.63,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is this the power of the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:15.97,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Did I get between \Nthe two of them after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:19.78,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No! I decided I wouldn't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:24.81,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This time, I have to make sure \NI get my feelings across!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.40,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, I came to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:40.24,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please don't leave me alone, Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:46.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, it's no use. You're too cute, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:47.40,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:52.45,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,This concludes our tour \Nof the castle interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:57.12,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,If you like, I could also show you \Nthe forest behind the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.10,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,Beautiful flowers bloom there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I would love to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:03.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:10.36,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're \Ndiscussing work, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:12.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But why on the terrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:15.38,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He said he'd be \Nin his office all day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:19.86,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,See? It looks like they're both \Nreturning to his office now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:22.37,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So it does. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:25.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It seems I was overthinking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:30.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It really is beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:33.92,Default,Forest FairyC,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Tiararose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.84,Default,Forest FairyD,0,0,0,,Hi, Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:40.55,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Hello. I see you're \Nas energetic as ever today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:45.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,By the way, I have \Nsome cookies. Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:47.35,Default,Forest FairyA,0,0,0,,Yay! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:49.51,Default,Forest FairyC,0,0,0,,They're so crispy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:52.20,Default,Forest FairyD,0,0,0,,Yummy! I love them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:54.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Th-They're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:58.08,Default,Forest FairyD,0,0,0,,Tiara! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.90,Default,Forest FairyA,0,0,0,,The king is up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:16.10,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The king?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:23.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.95,Default,Forest FairyD,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:30.10,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um... Fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.42,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:45.78,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,So you are Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.26,Default,Forest FairyC,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.54,Default,Forest FairyD,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.32,0:21:57.54,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The king... of the forest fairies?!
