Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:34.48,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,The forest fairies love you, \Nand you make good cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.32,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.74,0:23:39.13,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You may stay in my forest \Nas long as you like.
